# Runtime dependencies (directly imported by the application).
#
# This file lists DIRECT dependencies only. Pinned, hash-verified versions --
# including transitive dependencies -- live in requirements.txt, which is what
# CI and the release build install. Regenerate the lock after editing this file:
#
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 \
#       requirements.in -o requirements.txt
#
# Lower bounds below are security floors, not preferences. See CONTRIBUTING.md.

# GUI toolkit. PyQt6-WebEngine bundles Chromium and renders remote content in
